@startuml state-card-handle
title CardHandle Lifecycle

[*] --> ACTIVE : TUC_KON_001\n(card inserted / startup rebuild)
ACTIVE --> INVALIDATED : card ejected (CT/SLOT_FREE)\nor terminal disconnect
INVALIDATED --> [*] : cardHandle added to\n48-hour blacklist

note right of ACTIVE
  cardHandle registered in
  CardHandleRegistry.activeHandles
  CARD/INSERTED event fired
end note

note right of INVALIDATED
  handle removed from activeHandles
  CARD/REMOVED event fired
  handle blacklisted for 48 h
end note
@enduml
